    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure Forest Clicker: Craft Your Way to a Perfect Yard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Treasure Forest Clicker, a relaxing yet addictive clicker game where your goal is to tidy up a messy yard by clicking on trash and debris. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean, discover hidden items and resources that you can use to craft better tools, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making your cleaning efforts faster and more efficient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Satisfying Clicking Gameplay: Tap to remove junk and uncover useful materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Crafting System: Combine found items to create advanced tools and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Hidden Treasures: Search for rare diamonds\u2014collect them all to unlock a special reward by the end of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Progress &amp; Improve: Start small, but with smart crafting, turn your basic cleanup into a high-efficiency operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you transform this cluttered mess into a spotless paradise? Start clicking, crafting, and collecting today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure Forest Clicker: Craft Your Way to a Perfect Yard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Treasure Forest Clicker, a relaxing yet addictive clicker game where your goal is to tidy up a messy yard by clicking on trash and debris. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean, discover hidden items and resources that you can use to craft better tools, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making your cleaning efforts faster and more efficient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Satisfying Clicking Gameplay: Tap to remove junk and uncover useful materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Crafting System: Combine found items to create advanced tools and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Hidden Treasures: Search for rare diamonds\u2014collect them all to unlock a special reward by the end of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Progress &amp; Improve: Start small, but with smart crafting, turn your basic cleanup into a high-efficiency operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you transform this cluttered mess into a spotless paradise? Start clicking, crafting, and collecting today!</p>",
